{{ img:units/Vehicle Plant.png|Vehicle Plant}}
=Vehicle Plant=
*  Health: 16
*  Price: %Minerals% 80
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 2
*  Consumes: %Minerals%10
Enabled vehicle plants produce vehicles of arbitrary configuration at the expense of %Minerals%, and %time%. A vehicle plant that does not have access to the necessary [[concepts/resources]] switches off immediately. Vehicle plants should be placed so that any produced vehicles can stand in the immediate surroundings of the structure.
